                "reply_count": 131,
                "retweet_count": 18,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Don\u2019t forget, we \"Spring Forward\" tonight as Daylight Saving Time begins tomorrow. Personally, I dread losing an hour of sleep, and these biannual clock changes cause unnecessary challenges \u2013 especially for our Mississippi farmers. I\u2019ve long supported making DST permanent and am proud to support the Sunshine Protection Act, which would end the hassle of changing clocks for good.\n\nhttps://t.co/K2lhkpFgZe",
